      "y": 581,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 720,
      "label": "Conflict: The pre-registered refuting predictions are asymmetric. A sample that cannot separate the strategies (CI includes 0) refutes H-tuned and H-twofixed by their own criteria and leaves H-english standing. The statuses therefore follow from low power as much as from any real equivalence. Detecting a 0.1-guess difference would need roughly 900 paired seeds; detecting 0.25 guesses would need roughly 150. An equivalence margin and a sample size were never stated, so this disagreement between the 'refuted' and 'supported' labels and what the data can actually show stays unresolved., open"
